      "id": "word-que--relative",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "que",
      "answerEn": "who; that; which (relative pronoun)",
      "noteEn": "Que connects a noun to information describing it. Depending on the noun, English translates it as “who,” “that,” or “which.”",
      "example": {
        "es": "La persona que llamó es mi amiga.",
        "en": "The person who called is my friend."
